To leap given year, answering a Bool:
  year is an Int, trusted 256 of 256.
Check: leap of 2024 gives true, trusted 120.
Check: leap of 2023 gives false, trusted 120.
Check: leap of 1900 gives false, trusted 120.
Check: leap of 2000 gives true, trusted 120.
